ind":"announcement","title":"3,000+ Wishlists! Thank You for Your Support!","summary":"Hello, card collectors! TCG CARD CHAOS has passed 3,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉 It feels like we were just celebrating 2,000 wishlists, and now we’re already past 3,000. We couldn’t be happier! Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game, shared it with friends, and sent us their thoughts. For our small team, your support means so much. From cards scattered across the floor to neatly completed shelves, we’re excited to share this journey with you. There are still plenty of cards to sort—and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:52:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034147","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125130-1846651706687862","game_id":"steam-5125130","kind":"announcement","title":"TCG Card Chaos is joining Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello everyone! TCG Card Chaos is taking part in Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26! Step into a shop filled with scattered collectible cards and start bringing order to the chaos. Examine each card, find where it belongs, and enjoy watching the collection come together. Our free demo is already available, so you can jump in today! Whether you're discovering the game for the first time or returning to organize a few more cards, we'd love to hear what you think. Share your feedback here in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:39:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125130-1846651706675649","game_id":"steam-5125130","kind":"announcement","title":"2,000+ Wishlists — Thank You! 🎉","summary":"TCG Card Chaos has passed 2,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉 Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted the game, tried the demo, shared it with friends, or sent us feedback. Your support means a lot to our small team. We’re continuing to improve the game as we prepare for our October 27 release. If you haven’t tried it yet, check out the free demo and let us know what you think! Thank you for being part of this card-filled journey! ❤️ Odd Forge Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:27:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125130-1844751498235437","game_id":"steam-5125130","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: 160 Japanese Cards, 4 New Cabinets & a New Friend!","summary":"The latest TCG Card Chaos demo update is now live!What’s new?• 160 Japanese cards to collect and organize. • 4 new cabinets for the Japanese card sets. • A dog wandering around outside the glass-enclosed demo area.Fixes and improvements• Improved card physics to address overlapping and glitching when dropping cards onto a pile. • Performance optimizations throughout the demo. • Improvements to saving and loading.Update your demo and check out the new additions!Thank you for playing and sharing y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T20:51:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125130-1843481262698354","game_id":"steam-5125130","kind":"update","title":"TCG Card Chaos Demo – Visual Overhaul Update","summary":"Thanks for playing the TCG Card Chaos Demo!Demo Update 0.1.1 is now live!This update brings a major visual overhaul to the shop, refreshing its overall look and atmosphere.What's New• Redesigned shop walls and ceiling • New railings and fences • New lamps and improved lighting • Various environment improvements and visual polishThe shop now has a refreshed look and atmosphere as we continue preparing TCG Card Chaos for its full release.Thanks for playing, and thank you for all your feedback and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T20:55:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5125130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5125130":"2026-10-26T08:42:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5125130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:58Z"},"5144220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5125130","app_id":5125130,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ef7f4bbfad7f34f2cb7a99a6d64eb81b3a8c9544a02074a5a049d1e63d755d70","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"혼란스러운 카드 상점 곳곳에 흩어진 5,000장 이상의 수집용 카드를 정리하세요. 타입, 희귀도, 번호와 심볼을 확인하고, 카드 팩을 개봉하고, 등급이 매겨진 카드를 발견하여 모든 카드를 올바른 자리에 놓으세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Odd Forge Games"}],"developers":[{"name":